    "stem": "Chirag and Leela each start with the same whole roti. Chirag cuts his into $5$ equal pieces. Leela cuts hers into $5$ pieces of different sizes. Each takes one piece and calls it one-fifth of the roti.\n\nWhich statements are correct?",
